[BEGIN]
  ObjTp=Hd
  Cmn1=||3This module records calls made.  It is intended to be\\   used||1
  Cmn2=for an ATC Hybrid to provide functionality similar\\   to a cellular||1
  Cmn3=telephone.\\   \\   Init - This should be pulsed once on an initial||1
  Cmn4=program load only to clear out NVRAM and set default values\\\\||1
  Cmn5=||2PhoneNumberIn$ - Number dialed by the hybrid, usually an output||1
  Cmn6=of a dialer module.\\   AddNumber - Causes the number input on PhoneNumberIn$||1
  Cmn7=to be stored at the top of the list.\\   Page First/Up/Down/Last||1
  Cmn8=- scrolls pages of the call history log\\	   \\   Select 1-X - Select||1
  Cmn9=an entry in the call history log\\   Select 1-X FB - current selected||1
  Cmn10=entry\\   Dial - Triggers the selected entry to be output on PhoneNumberOut$||1
  Cmn11=and the DialOut to be triggered.	\\\\   PhoneNumberOut$ - Number||1
  Cmn12=to be dialed, this needs to be fed into ATC hybrid modules.\\||3
  Cmn13=DialOut - Dial trigger on Phone NumberOut$ changing
[END]
